  "status": "Approved",
  "description": "The proposal is to construct a five storey (ground & 4 floors) Green Engineering Building, primarily using Cross Laminated Timber (CLT) to minimise embodied carbon. The new building will provide:\n- Workshop spaces for carpentry, electrical and bricklaying trades\n- Specialist laboratories and classrooms for teaching green technologies\n- A new landscaped quad offering outdoor amenity space for students and staff\n- Improved access, circulation and sustainability infrastructure\n- Green roofs and integrated biodiversity measures\n\nThe proposed development responds to the council’s call for ambitious, sustainable infrastructure projects and significantly enhances educational provision without increasing car usage. \n",
